# The theme - licensed separately, deliberately not committed.
#
# Template/ is the commercial "Barrel" WordPress theme (ThemeForest / Envato).
# Its license does not permit redistributing the theme source, so it is excluded
# from this public repository.
#
# CONSEQUENCE: a fresh clone of this repo will NOT render. index.html links 14
# stylesheets and 20+ scripts that all live under Template/css, Template/js and
# Template/fonts. You get the markup and the custom layer only.
#
# To run it locally you must supply your own licensed copy of the theme:
#   1. Drop it in as ./Template/            (from your Envato download)
#   2. Open index.html
#
# See README.md -> "Running it locally".

